<title>UK: Raine says in takeover talks, share rises.</title>
<headline>Raine says in takeover talks, share rises.</headline>
<dateline>LONDON 1997-04-21</dateline>
<text>
<p>British house building group Raine Plc said on Monday it was in talks with a third party which may lead to a takeover offer.</p>
<p>Raine said a possible offer could be made at what it called a modest premium to the current share price of around 19.5p per share.</p>
<p>Raine said it did not expect the talks, if successful, to be concluded for &quot;a number of weeks&quot;. It gave no further details.</p>
<p>Raine shares rose as high as 21p after the announcement.</p>
